# NOTE(yigit): There is no blanket *.obj here, and there must not be.  A
# Wavefront model and an MSVC object file share an extension, and the blanket
# pattern silently swallowed cube.obj - the lamp markers stopped drawing and
# nothing reported it, because a model that fails to load draws nothing by
# design.  The compiler's .obj files land in build/, which is ignored whole a
# few lines up, so the pattern was never doing any work in the first place.

# Models I did not make.  cube.obj is written here and stays.
# Sponza - Crytek/Frank Meinl, via casual-effects.com.
handmade/data/sponza.obj
handmade/data/sponza.mtl
handmade/data/textures/

# Consolas - Microsoft licensed, not mine to redistribute.
handmade/data/font.ttf
